          <p class="lead">
            The future begins with a question — and the courage to explore it.
          </p>

          <p>
            ASTROVYN is an independent, student-led initiative built around
            a simple belief: curiosity can become the starting point of
            meaningful innovation.
          </p>

          <p>
            We explore scientific concepts, investigate emerging technologies,
            develop project ideas, and document our learning journey. Our
            goal is to turn questions into research, research into practical
            experiments, and promising ideas into projects that can be shared
            with the world.
          </p>

          <p>
            From the mysteries of the universe to the possibilities of
            intelligent machines, ASTROVYN is a space for learning,
            experimentation, and ambitious thinking.
          </p>

