            <span>why.</span>”
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-list reveal delay-1">

          <div class="principle-item">
            <span class="sym">✳</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Curiosity First</h4>
              <p>
                Ask questions, challenge assumptions, and stay open
                to learning something new.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="principle-item">
            <span class="sym">✳</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Research with Purpose</h4>
              <p>
                Use evidence, reliable information, and careful reasoning
                to understand complex ideas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="principle-item">
            <span class="sym">✳</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Learn by Building</h4>
              <p>
                Connect theory with practical work, experiments,
                simulations, and creative problem-solving.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="principle-item">
            <span class="sym">✳</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Share Knowledge</h4>
              <p>
                Communicate discoveries clearly and make learning
                a collaborative journey.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

